rning/fact-sheets/making-a-law.html). The bill will now be sent back to the House of Representatives where our Members of Parliament (MPs) will decide whether they agree with the Senate's amendments. ### What does this bill do? This bill delivers on a 2016 election commitment and creates the Regional Investment Corporation *\"to administer farm business loans and financial assistance granted to states and territories in relation to water infrastructure projects\"*. More information about the bill is available in its [bills digest](https://www.aph.gov.au/Parliamentary_Business/Bills_Legislation/bd/bd1718a/18bd013).","result":"affirmative","slug":"division-federal-senate-5089","source_url":"https://theyvoteforyou.org.au/divisions/senate/2018-02-06/2"}
